{{!
    @template format_dari/card_media

    The top of a section card or an activity card (2.5.0).

    With an image it shows the picture, and a status chip when the status says something
    (In progress, Completed). Without an image it is a panel in the card's colour (the course accent
    unless the teacher picked one) carrying the card's label and title in large type, with the
    section's icon or the activity's module icon. The panel is always in the markup and hidden by
    CSS while an image is shown, so the edit-mode tools can switch between the two in place.

    The whole element is decorative for assistive technology apart from the edit tools: the
    card's title link carries its name and state.

    Classes / attributes required for JS (format_dari/cardimage):
    * drf-media root with data-cardtype, data-cardid, data-courseid, data-cardname,
      data-imagesource, data-colour, data-eyebrow.
    * drf-tools__btn buttons with data-action upload | ai | colour | remove.

    Context variables required for this template:
    * cardtype string section or cm. cardid, courseid int. cardname string plain text.
    * hasimage bool / imageurl string / imagesource string card, banner or empty.
    * colour string #rrggbb or empty. islight bool Colour is light: panel text is dark.
    * covereyebrow string Panel label, e.g. "Module 2"; empty for activities.
    * covertitle string PRE-ESCAPED card name (format_string()); triple mustache.
    * hasplaceholdersvg bool / placeholdersvg string PRE-ESCAPED icon markup from the plugin's own
      icon library, never user input. hasplaceholdericon bool / placeholdericonurl string.
    * hasstatus bool / status string progress or complete / statuslabel string.
    * isediting bool / canremove bool / uploadlabel, ailabel, colourlabel, removelabel string.

    Example context (json):
    {
        "cardtype": "section", "cardid": 35, "courseid": 2, "cardname": "Measuring Performance",
        "hasimage": false, "imageurl": "", "imagesource": "", "colour": "#0f766e", "islight": false,
        "covereyebrow": "Module 4", "covertitle": "Measuring Performance",
        "hasplaceholdersvg": false, "placeholdersvg": "", "hasplaceholdericon": false,
        "placeholdericonurl": "", "hasstatus": false, "status": "", "statuslabel": "",
        "isediting": false, "canremove": false
    }
}}
<div class="drf-media{{#hasimage}} drf-media--image{{/hasimage}}{{#islight}} drf-media--light{{/islight}}" data-cardtype="{{cardtype}}" data-cardid="{{cardid}}" data-courseid="{{courseid}}" data-cardname="{{cardname}}" data-eyebrow="{{covereyebrow}}" data-imagesource="{{imagesource}}" data-colour="{{colour}}">
<div class="drf-media__panel" aria-hidden="true">
<div class="drf-media__top">{{!
}}{{#hasplaceholdersvg}}<span class="drf-media__icon"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" focusable="false">{{{placeholdersvg}}}</svg></span>{{/hasplaceholdersvg}}{{!
}}{{#hasplaceholdericon}}<span class="drf-media__icon"><img src="{{placeholdericonurl}}" alt=""></span>{{/hasplaceholdericon}}{{!
}}{{#covereyebrow}}<span class="drf-media__eyebrow">{{covereyebrow}}</span>{{/covereyebrow}}{{!
}}</div>
<span class="drf-media__title">{{{covertitle}}}</span>
</div>
{{#hasimage}}<img class="drf-media__img" src="{{imageurl}}" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async">{{/hasimage}}
{{#hasstatus}}<span class="drf-status drf-status--{{status}}" aria-hidden="true">{{#iscomplete}}<svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="butt" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5.75 12.5 10 16.75 18.25 8.25" stroke-width="2"/></svg>{{/iscomplete}}{{^iscomplete}}<span class="drf-status__dot"></span>{{/iscomplete}}{{statuslabel}}</span>{{/hasstatus}}
{{#isediting}}
<div class="drf-tools">{{!
}}<button type="button" class="drf-tools__btn" data-action="upload" aria-label="{{uploadlabel}}" title="{{#str}} cardimage_upload, format_dari {{/str}}"><svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="butt" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M4.75 14.25v3.5a2.5 2.5 0 0 0 2.5 2.5h9.5a2.5 2.5 0 0 0 2.5-2.5v-3.5" fill="currentColor" fill-opacity=".16"/><path d="M12 15V4.75M8 8.75l4-4 4 4"/></svg></button>{{!
}}{{#aiimages}}<button type="button" class="drf-tools__btn drf-tools__btn--ai" data-action="ai" aria-label="{{ailabel}}" title="{{#str}} cardimage_ai, format_dari {{/str}}"><svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="butt" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M10.5 3.5c.5 4.1 2.9 6.5 7 7-4.1.5-6.5 2.9-7 7-.5-4.1-2.9-6.5-7-7 4.1-.5 6.5-2.9 7-7z" fill="currentColor" fill-opacity=".16"/><path d="M18.25 14.25c.2 1.6.9 2.3 2.5 2.5-1.6.2-2.3.9-2.5 2.5-.2-1.6-.9-2.3-2.5-2.5 1.6-.2 2.3-.9 2.5-2.5z" fill="currentColor" stroke="none"/></svg></button>{{/aiimages}}{{!
}}<button type="button" class="drf-tools__btn" data-action="colour" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-label="{{colourlabel}}" title="{{#str}} cardimage_colour, format_dari {{/str}}"><svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="butt" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 3.5s6 6.2 6 10.5a6 6 0 0 1-12 0c0-4.3 6-10.5 6-10.5z" fill="currentColor" fill-opacity=".16"/><path d="M9.25 14.5a2.75 2.75 0 0 0 2.75 2.75"/></svg></button>{{!
}}<button type="button" class="drf-tools__btn drf-tools__btn--remove" data-action="remove"{{^canremove}} hidden{{/canremove}} aria-label="{{removelabel}}" title="{{#str}} cardimage_remove, format_dari {{/str}}"><svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="butt" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M6.5 6.75l.85 11.6a2 2 0 0 0 2 1.85h5.3a2 2 0 0 0 2-1.85l.85-11.6" fill="currentColor" fill-opacity=".16"/><path d="M4.75 6.75h14.5M9.75 6.75v-2.5h4.5v2.5"/></svg></button>{{!
}}</div>
<div class="drf-media__busy" hidden><span class="drf-media__spinner" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="drf-media__busytext"></span></div>
{{/isediting}}
</div>
